            "On the way to the store, I bought bread"
          ],
          "answer": 1,
          "say": "Markete gitmişken ekmek de al.",
          "explanation": "-mişken means “since you're already …, anyway.” The first thing is already done."
        },
        {
          "id": "4",
          "type": "multiple_choice",
          "prompt": "Tam çıkacakken telefon çaldı.",
          "options": [
            "Just as I was about to leave, the phone rang",
